### Create Company
POST http://localhost:8080/api/companies
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

{
  "name": "Super Real Estate LLC"
}

### List Companies
POST http://localhost:8080/api/companies/list
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

{
  "page": 0,
  "size": 20
}

### Get Company
GET http://localhost:8080/api/companies/1
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### Update Company
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/companies/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

{
  "name": "Super Real Estate Global",
  "address": "Tashkent, Amir Temur 1"
}

### Update Company Status
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/companies/1/status
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

{
  "status": "ACTIVE"
}

### Get Company Config
GET http://localhost:8080/api/companies/1/config
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### Update Company Config
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/companies/1/config
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

{
  "dialWindowStart": "09:00:00",
  "dialWindowEnd": "20:00:00",
  "timezone": "Asia/Tashkent",
  "defaultLanguage": "uz-UZ",
  "supportedLanguages": ["uz-UZ", "ru-RU"],
  "disclosureText": "Assalomu alaykum! Bu {company} kompaniyasining avtomatik ovozli xizmati. Suhbat yozib olinmoqda."
}
